            "showLineNumbers": false,
            "showMiniMap": false
          },
          "content": "## Incident Response — Grafana IRM → ServiceNow\n\nWhen the correlated alert fires, Grafana IRM automatically:\n1. **Creates a dedicated incident room** with full context (host, CVE, threat name, CVSS score, analyst assignments)\n2. **Pushes a structured ticket** into ServiceNow via the ServiceNow contact point\n3. **Notifies on-call team** via PagerDuty / Slack / Teams routing rules\n\n\u003e **Enterprise demo:** Switch the datasource panel below to point to your live ServiceNow instance using the [ServiceNow Grafana plugin](https://grafana.com/grafana/plugins/grafana-servicenow-datasource/) to show real tickets.\n\n| Field | Value |\n|---|---|\n| Contact Point | ServiceNow REST API (`/api/now/table/incident`) |\n| Notification Policy | Critical → ServiceNow + PagerDuty; High → ServiceNow + Slack |\n| Auto-populate fields | `short_description`, `priority`, `assignment_group`, `description` from alert annotations |",
          "mode": "markdown"
        },
        "pluginVersion": "10.4.1",
        "type": "text"
      },
